1058
01:13:01,761 --> 01:13:04,461
小籠包に見えちゃう。お腹空きすぎか？
It looks like xiaolongbao. Am I just too hungry?

1059
01:13:04,461 --> 01:13:06,461
お腹空きすぎなのじゃ。
I must be way too hungry.

1060
01:13:07,461 --> 01:13:10,461
えーっと、その小包をそこに置いて貰えますか？
Uh, "Can you put those packages there?"

1061
01:13:10,461 --> 01:13:11,961
Can you...

1062
01:13:20,761 --> 01:13:23,461
待って。packagesって書いてるよ、おぬしら。
Wait. It says "packages", guys.

1063
01:13:23,961 --> 01:13:24,961
見て。
Look.

1064
01:13:25,461 --> 01:13:28,461
packagesって書いてる。
It says "packages".

1065
01:13:30,961 --> 01:13:33,961
複数じゃからtheいらないんじゃない？
Since it's plural, doesn't it not need "the"?

1066
01:13:33,961 --> 01:13:35,961
Can you put packages...

1067
01:13:37,961 --> 01:13:39,461
...there?

1068
01:13:40,461 --> 01:13:41,961
なんじゃない？
Isn't it?

1069
01:13:41,961 --> 01:13:42,761
Go!

1070
01:13:42,761 --> 01:13:45,961
えー！なんで？！Why why why why!
Eh?! Why?! Why why why why!

1071
01:13:45,961 --> 01:13:48,761
おい、Why! 見て、theいるって、the!
Hey, why! Look, it says it needs "the", "the"!

1072
01:13:48,761 --> 01:13:51,961
なんでなんでなんで？なんで？Why?
Why why why? Why? Why?

1073
01:13:51,961 --> 01:13:53,961
おかしい！おかしいのじゃ！
That's strange! That makes no sense!

1074
01:13:53,961 --> 01:13:54,961
え？
Huh?

1075
01:13:54,961 --> 01:13:57,961
だって、わし考えた。考えて...
Because I thought about it. I thought about it...

1076
01:13:57,961 --> 01:13:59,961
考えた上で間違えた！
and after thinking about it, I got it wrong!

1077
01:13:59,961 --> 01:14:00,961
Why? なんでなんでなんで？
Why? Why why why?

1078
01:14:02,761 --> 01:14:06,761
Why we need "the"? Why we need "the"?
Why do we need "the"? Why do we need "the"?

1079
01:14:09,461 --> 01:14:11,461
え、複数形だよ！
Wait, it's plural!

1080
01:14:11,461 --> 01:14:14,461
This is "s", "s", "s"!

1081
01:14:14,461 --> 01:14:17,461
忘れてない、忘れてない！意図的に抜いた！
I didn't forget, I didn't forget! I omitted it intentionally!

1082
01:14:17,461 --> 01:14:19,961
意図的に抜いたのに！
Even though I intentionally left it out!

1083
01:14:19,961 --> 01:14:20,961
なんで？！
Why?!

1084
01:14:22,961 --> 01:14:27,461
"Which packages"なのじゃ？いや、そりゃ分かるけどさ！
"Which packages"? Well, I get that part, but...

1085
01:14:27,461 --> 01:14:28,961
複数形だよ！
It's plural!

1086
01:14:28,961 --> 01:14:29,961
は？え？
Huh? What?

1087
01:14:31,961 --> 01:14:35,961
"A" is never used with plurals,

1088
01:14:35,961 --> 01:14:37,961
but specific...

1089
01:14:38,961 --> 01:14:42,461
"The" is still necessary? 何それ？！
"The" is still necessary? What is that?!

1090
01:14:42,461 --> 01:14:45,461
何それ？！そうなの？！
What is that?! Is that true?!

1091
01:14:45,461 --> 01:14:47,461
theはいいの？
"The" is allowed?

1092
01:14:48,761 --> 01:14:49,961
え、それ知らなかった。
Wait, I didn't know that.

1093
01:14:49,961 --> 01:14:51,461
それ知らなかった！
I didn't know that!

1094
01:14:52,461 --> 01:14:54,761
それ知らなかったよ、わし。
I didn't know that at all.

1095
01:14:55,961 --> 01:14:57,461
theはいいの？
"The" is allowed?

1096
01:14:59,461 --> 01:15:00,961
Sついててもthe
Even with an "S", "the"...

1097
01:15:00,882 --> 01:15:02,082
ありなの？
Is that allowed?

1098
01:15:02,232 --> 01:15:03,382
そんな...
No way...

1099
01:15:03,882 --> 01:15:05,582
NO WAY! MEMORIZE!

1100
01:15:05,982 --> 01:15:08,282
いや、でもさ、いや、それもいいと思うんだけどさ...
Wait, but... I mean, I guess that's fine too, but...

1101
01:15:08,582 --> 01:15:14,482
一問一答で暗記してるだけじゃ、応用できないのじゃん。
If you just memorize it question by question, you can't apply it to other things.

1102
01:15:15,382 --> 01:15:18,182
複数形でも「the」入るんだ。
So 'the' can go with plural forms too?

1103
01:15:18,882 --> 01:15:22,882
「a」だけなんだね。ONLY 「a」？ ONLY 「a」なんだ。
So it's only 'a' then? Only 'a'? It's only 'a'.

1104
01:15:23,082 --> 01:15:26,382
「the」は複数関係ないの？ え、知らなかったのじゃ。
'the' has nothing to do with plurals? Huh, I didn't know that.

1105
01:15:28,582 --> 01:15:31,682
「the」 for plurals, 「a」...
'the' for plurals, 'a'...

1106
01:15:33,282 --> 01:15:39,082
「the」 for plurals, 「a」 for singular, but 「the」 for specific...
'the' for plurals, 'a' for singular, but 'the' for specific...

1107
01:15:39,682 --> 01:15:40,882
なるほど。
I see.

1108
01:15:42,482 --> 01:15:45,582
「the」は複数関係ないのか。それ知らなかった。
So 'the' doesn't depend on plural or not. I didn't know that.

1109
01:15:46,182 --> 01:15:48,882
I, I didn't know that.
I didn't know that.

1110
01:15:49,382 --> 01:15:53,182
Okay. Okay, okay.

1111
01:15:53,582 --> 01:15:57,382
でも、わしは分かってたよ。あの...「その小包」だから...
