1112
01:15:57,682 --> 01:16:04,282
「その小包」だから、「the」が複数でもOKなことさえ知っていれば解けていた。
Because it meant 'those packages', if I had just known 'the' works with plurals, I would have gotten it right.

1113
01:16:04,882 --> 01:16:06,882
理解さえすればできるのじゃん。
So I can do it once I understand the rule!

1114
01:16:08,282 --> 01:16:12,282
Okay. Okay, okay, okay.

1115
01:16:12,682 --> 01:16:14,482
ほら、覚えゲーなのじゃん。
See? It's just a memory game.

1116
01:16:16,382 --> 01:16:18,882
You're learning. Yes, I'm learning.

1117
01:16:19,482 --> 01:16:20,282
Yes.

1118
01:16:20,882 --> 01:16:22,882
Okay.

1119
01:16:23,082 --> 01:16:28,082
Okay. えー、Can you...
Okay. Uh, Can you...

1120
01:16:30,282 --> 01:16:34,082
put the...

1121
01:16:34,582 --> 01:16:41,282
「その小包」、その小包、「the packages」...
'Those packages', those packages, 'the packages'...

1122
01:16:41,682 --> 01:16:45,582
there. Okay. 分かった！
there. Okay. Got it!

1123
01:16:47,182 --> 01:16:48,282
まだかな？
Is that right?

1124
01:16:49,182 --> 01:16:53,582
Big learning. Yes, big learning. 分かった！
Big learning. Yes, big learning. Got it!

1125
01:16:54,882 --> 01:16:56,582
ふんふんふんふん。
Mm-hmm.

1126
01:16:58,482 --> 01:16:59,882
なるほどね。
I see.

