難しくね？ これを中学生がやるの？
Isn't it hard? Middle schoolers do this?

1130
01:17:19,682 --> 01:17:26,382
Maybe Japanese... 何だっけ？ 中学生度忘れしたわ。
Maybe Japanese... what was it? I forgot how to say middle school student.

1131
01:17:27,382 --> 01:17:36,582
Middle school student? が、これやるよね？ Learn this.
Middle school students do this, right? Learn this.

1132
