中学だよね？ 中学英語だよね、多分この文法って。
It's middle school, right? This grammar is probably middle school English.

1134
01:17:48,382 --> 01:17:54,882
めっちゃ難しくない？ It's really difficult じゃない？ Junior high school, junior high school?
Isn't it super hard? It's really difficult, isn't it? Junior high school, junior high school?

1135
01:17:57,682 --> 01:17:59,082
難しくない？
Isn't it hard?

1136
01:18:02,682 --> 01:18:05,482
中学生でやるよね？
They do this in middle school, right?

1137
01:18:05,682 --> 01:18:10,882
なんか習ったよ。「a」とか「the」とか中学の英語で習ったなって思うよ。忘れてるけど。
