1157
01:20:03,553 --> 01:20:06,303
No, I have... reason to study.
No, I have... a reason to study.

1158
01:20:06,803 --> 01:20:12,403
So I'm studying now, but... なきゃ出来無いのじゃ。
So I'm studying now, but... I can't do things unless I have a reason.

1159
01:20:15,003 --> 01:20:20,503
Yes, you didn't need to learn English when you were in school, yes.

1160
