1179
01:22:07,703 --> 01:22:15,603
I watch Phineas and Ferb and learn English, yes. I learn English with Phineas and Ferb.
I watched Phineas and Ferb and learned English, yes. I learned English with Phineas and Ferb.

1180
01:22:16,703 --> 01:22:20,303
ずっと、ずっとアニメ見てやってたよ。
I watched cartoons all the time to learn.

