1188
01:23:04,303 --> 01:23:10,303
Yes, I know. なんか靴ひもについてのなんか歌番組みたいな。
Yes, I know. Like a musical show about shoelaces.

1189
01:23:10,303 --> 01:23:11,403
Yes, I know.

1190
