Yes, I know. I might have watched SpongeBob too. I watched a bit of SpongeBob.

1191
01:23:18,203 --> 01:23:19,003
Yes.

1192
01:23:26,603 --> 01:23:33,203
ん？Mela is evil? Mela is not evil! めらは違う。Mela is not.
Hmm? Mela is evil? Mela is not evil! I'm not. Mela is not.

1193
01:23:33,203 --> 01:23:34,103
Yes.

1194
01:23:43,303 --> 01:23:50,203
ローラーコースター？ジェットコースター？え、でもローラーコースターで学んだ気がするぜ。のじゃ。
Roller coaster? Jet coaster? Wait, I feel like I learned "roller coaster" from that show.

1195
01:23:52,703 --> 01:23:53,403
Yes.

